#: knewthemedlg.cpp:31
msgid "New Theme"
msgstr "Thema Newydd"

#: kthememanager.cpp:58
msgid "KDE Theme Manager"
msgstr "Rheolydd Thema KDE"

#: kthememanager.cpp:59 kthememanager.cpp:65
msgid ""
"This control module handles installing, removing and creating visual KDE "
"themes."
msgstr ""
"Mae'r modiwl rheoli yma yn trin arsefydlu, gwaredu a chreu themau KDE "
"gweledol."

